flowchart TD
    Start([Task Received])
    Start --> TierSelect{Assigned Tier?}

    TierSelect -->|fast| FastAttempt[Ollama Local - Qwen 14B or 7B]
    TierSelect -->|medium| MediumAttempt[Gemini Flash 2.5 via API]
    TierSelect -->|heavy| HeavyAttempt[Claude Opus 4.6 via subprocess]

    FastAttempt --> FastResult{Success?}
    FastResult -->|Yes| Done([Return Result])
    FastResult -->|No - error/timeout/quota| FallbackFromFast{Fallback enabled?}
    FallbackFromFast -->|Yes| MediumAttempt
    FallbackFromFast -->|No| Failed([Return Error])

    MediumAttempt --> MediumResult{Success?}
    MediumResult -->|Yes| Done
    MediumResult -->|No| FallbackFromMedium{Fallback enabled?}
    FallbackFromMedium -->|Yes| FastAttempt2[Ollama Local - fallback]
    FallbackFromMedium -->|No| Failed

    FastAttempt2 --> FastResult2{Success?}
    FastResult2 -->|Yes| Done
    FastResult2 -->|No| Failed

    HeavyAttempt --> HeavyResult{Success?}
    HeavyResult -->|Yes| Done
    HeavyResult -->|No| FallbackFromHeavy{Fallback chain}
    FallbackFromHeavy --> MediumAttempt2[Gemini Flash - first fallback]

    MediumAttempt2 --> MedResult2{Success?}
    MedResult2 -->|Yes| Done
    MedResult2 -->|No| FastAttempt3[Ollama Local - last resort]

    FastAttempt3 --> FastResult3{Success?}
    FastResult3 -->|Yes| Done
    FastResult3 -->|No| AdminAlert[Telegram Alert to Mike]
    AdminAlert --> Failed

    subgraph CostTiers[Cost Tiers]
        Free[Fast Tier - $0 - Ollama local]
        Cents[Medium Tier - ~$0.001/call - Gemini/OpenRouter]
        Dollars[Heavy Tier - subscription - Claude Opus]
    end

    subgraph PerAgentDefaults[Per-Agent Tier Defaults]
        HB[Heartbeat: medium with fast fallback]
        ME[Memory Extractor: medium]
        AN[Analyzer: medium]
        CU[Curator: medium]
        SG[Skill Generator: heavy]
    end
